                        "entry_id": "fc27e632-45f7-3b84-bc16-4fab53ae5a5c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any myriapod of the class Chilopoda, a centipede."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "93f1ebe6-1406-4547-bf3e-728b5aee5ea5",
                                "sense_id": "db075d52-d3df-31f4-9531-3ca6cb7e0685",
                                "text": "Consequently most chilopods are carnivorous, searching for earthworms, enchytraeids, and insects."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68004784-74b1-4304-ad46-6e207f4a976a",
                                "sense_id": "db075d52-d3df-31f4-9531-3ca6cb7e0685",
                                "text": "Important predatory groups in the beech forest at Göttinger Wald are chilopods, spiders, carabid and staphylinid beetles and gamasid mites. Chilopods consume a high proportion of collembolan populations and of other saprophagous groups (Poser, 1988, 1991)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20b37e8f-5a62-44b4-9ee7-5a35ec42fed0",
                                "sense_id": "db075d52-d3df-31f4-9531-3ca6cb7e0685",
                                "text": "However, the authors point out that the motoneurons' morphologies are dissimilar in hexapods and chilopods, a fact that argues against a homology of hexapodan and chilopodan longitudinal muscle motoneurons."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
